return {
    ["quest.L"]="The other signal",
    ["quest.L2"]="About Matrix 13",
    ["quest.PT"]="A Second Signal",
    ["quest.PD"]="While Lily searched for the signal from Adam's hover bike, she picked up something else. She wanted to talk to EVE about it before they set off.",
    ["quest.PM"]="Lily picked up something while tracking the bike. She is waiting by the Tetrapod.",
    ["quest.T"]="On Time",
    ["quest.D"]="While Lily searched for the signal from Adam's hover bike, she picked up a second one from the Great Desert. At 18:00 exactly, an automatic announcement from Matrix 13 station played, signed by Cryo Technology Matrix Metropolitan Railway Co., Ltd. Someone had added one line at the end.\n\n\"This lift stays in service so that those who left can come home.\"\n\nThat night, a child's voice came on the same frequency. She was calling for help, over and over. Adam's bike came first. Lily sent the location to the Tetrapod anyway. EVE said they would be quick.",
    ["quest.M1"]="An announcement and a child's call are coming from Matrix 13 station, under the Great Desert. The Tetrapod has the location. Go down to the station.",
    ["quest.M2"]="The station is empty. Still, someone kept the trains running on time. Find the way down to the distribution level.",
    ["quest.M3"]="The call said the very bottom, by the pumps. Cross the distribution level and find the pump shaft.",
    ["quest.M4"]="Climb down the pump shaft. The pump hall is at the bottom.",
    ["quest.M5"]="The call came from here. Get through the pump hall and find her.",
    ["quest.M6"]="Go back up and tell Lily what you found under the sand.",
    ["quest.K1"]="Go to Matrix 13 station",
    ["quest.K2"]="Reach the distribution level",
    ["quest.K3"]="Reach the pump shaft",
    ["quest.K4"]="Reach the pump hall",
    ["quest.K5"]="Find the child who called",
    ["talk.prologue.01"]="EVE, wait a second.",
    ["talk.prologue.02"]="While I was tracking the bike's signal, I picked up something else on an old railway band.",
    ["talk.prologue.03"]="An automatic announcement from Matrix 13 station, yesterday evening at 18:00 sharp.",
    ["talk.prologue.04"]="Go on, I'm listening.",
    ["talk.prologue.05"]="Someone added a sentence at the end of the message.",
    ["talk.prologue.06"]="What sentence?",
    ["talk.prologue.07"]="Here, listen.",
    ["talk.prologue.08"]="\"This lift stays in service...\"",
    ["talk.prologue.09"]="\"...so that those who left can come home.\"",
    ["talk.prologue.10"]="That message could be years old.",
    ["talk.prologue.11"]="Maybe, yes...",
    ["talk.prologue.12"]="But during the night, a child's voice came on the same frequency, right after the announcement.",
    ["talk.prologue.13"]="She's calling for help, again and again...",
    ["talk.prologue.14"]="Lily, Adam's bike comes first. You know that.",
    ["talk.prologue.15"]="I know. But if someone's still alive down there, we can't act like we never heard it.",
    ["talk.prologue.16"]="... All right.",
    ["talk.prologue.17"]="Send the location to the Tetrapod. We'll be quick.",
    ["talk.arrival.01"]="Lily, give me a report on that signal.",
    ["talk.arrival.02"]="Uh... right. One second.",
    ["talk.arrival.03"]="The signal's source is right here.",
    ["talk.arrival.04"]="The call comes from below, it's a lot like Matrix 11...",
    ["talk.arrival.05"]="I'd like to know why you didn't mention it sooner.",
    ["talk.arrival.06"]="I thought it was an old recording. And there was the bike...",
    ["talk.arrival.07"]="Then that voice came on and I couldn't keep quiet.",
    ["talk.arrival.08"]="... Lily, stay focused. We have to be quick.",
    ["talk.arrival.09"]="And then, Raven and the bike.",
    ["talk.finale.01"]="EVE, there you are!",
    ["talk.finale.02"]="I lost you on the stairs, nothing was getting through.",
    ["talk.finale.03"]="And Noa? Did you get there in time?",
    ["talk.finale.04"]="...",
    ["talk.finale.05"]="No... by a few minutes, Lily.",
    ["talk.finale.06"]="...",
    ["talk.finale.07"]="She fell asleep by the radio, counting.",
    ["talk.finale.08"]="And Yohan?",
    ["talk.finale.09"]="He tried to open the door to get her some air. He never got up.",
    ["talk.finale.10"]="We only heard her before dawn...",
    ["talk.finale.11"]="And the first lift didn't go down until 06:20. We couldn't have been faster.",
    ["talk.finale.12"]="I know.",
    ["talk.finale.13"]="There's still citizen 303, the one Yohan wanted us to tell.",
    ["talk.finale.14"]="Then we'll find her, I promise.",
    ["talk.finale.15"]="There's something else... the band changed after you came out.",
    ["talk.finale.16"]="Listen.",
    ["talk.finale.17"]="\"This is Mila, crane operator, Matrix 13.\"",
    ["talk.finale.18"]="\"Yohan came back for us. Don't come back down... I'm coming up.\"",
    ["talk.finale.19"]="Keep listening, Lily.",
    ["talk.zone.1A.01"]="EVE, I can still hear you. The comm holds up at this depth.",
    ["talk.zone.1A.02"]="There's hardly any sand on the floor.",
    ["talk.zone.1A.03"]="You mean someone still sweeps down here?",
    ["talk.zone.1A.04"]="Looks like it.",
    ["talk.zone.1A.05"]="Maybe that announcement wasn't so old after all...",
    ["talk.zone.1B.01"]="His chair faces the lift.",
    ["talk.zone.1B.02"]="\"So that those who left can come home\"... So he's the one who added that line.",
    ["talk.zone.1B.03"]="He's not here.",
    ["talk.zone.1B.04"]="He must be further down, like the girl.",
    ["talk.zone.1C.01"]="Wait, EVE, right in front of you... Is that a body?",
    ["talk.zone.1C.02"]="Yes. He's been here a while.",
    ["talk.zone.1C.03"]="He had a chair and a lamp... Looks like he kept watch on his own.",
    ["talk.zone.1C.04"]="Probably.",
    ["talk.zone.1C.05"]="And nobody came back for him.",
    ["talk.zone.1C.06"]="Whatever killed him can't be far. Stay with me, Lily.",
    ["talk.zone.1D.01"]="I found the line's timetable. A train comes in on this track at 07:10, every morning.",
    ["talk.zone.1D.02"]="With this rubble, it couldn't get through.",
    ["talk.zone.1D.03"]="Someone must have cleared the track before. You can see it on the rails.",
    ["talk.zone.1D.04"]="Nobody did it this morning.",
    ["talk.zone.1E.01"]="The station map stops here. Next is the distribution level.",
    ["talk.zone.1E.02"]="And the signal?",
    ["talk.zone.1E.03"]="Still below us, it hasn't moved. We'll have to go all the way down, EVE.",
    ["talk.zone.2A.01"]="Are those citizen numbers, on that wall?",
    ["talk.zone.2A.02"]="Yes. Thirty numbers in chalk. Someone put candles under them.",
    ["talk.zone.2A.03"]="They wrote down their dead here...",
    ["talk.zone.2A.04"]="The last number is whiter than the others.",
    ["talk.zone.2A.05"]="So someone still came up here. Let's hurry, please.",
    ["talk.zone.2B.01"]="EVE, against the wall, there... Tell me that's not what I think it is.",
    ["talk.zone.2B.02"]="It's a citizen. They wrapped him up.",
    ["talk.zone.2B.03"]="Wrapped? You mean he was still alive when...",
    ["talk.zone.2B.04"]="I don't know, Lily.",
    ["talk.zone.2B.05"]="... Sorry. Keep going, I'm watching the signals.",
    ["talk.zone.2C.01"]="Wait, I'm on this room's circuit. A lamp is blinking on the pump line, with no rhythm at all.",
    ["talk.zone.2C.02"]="A fault?",
    ["talk.zone.2C.03"]="No, a fault wouldn't do that. Someone's pressing it by hand, right now.",
    ["talk.zone.2C.04"]="They're alive.",
    ["talk.zone.2C.05"]="At least one, yes.",
    ["talk.zone.2D.01"]="There's a heap down there that's moving.",
    ["talk.zone.2D.02"]="It's just waste, right? The drones have been dumping it there for years.",
    ["talk.zone.2D.03"]="Look closer, Lily.",
    ["talk.zone.2E.01"]="EVE...! Is that a Gardener? This deep down?",
    ["talk.zone.2E.02"]="I saw them from my drop pod.",
    ["talk.zone.2E.03"]="Then don't stand still, it'll shell you!",
    ["talk.zone.2F.01"]="(breathing) ... That smell.",
    ["talk.zone.2F.02"]="It's corrosive. Whatever you do, keep it off your skin.",
    ["talk.zone.2F.03"]="It had been down there for six years, right under their feet.",
    ["talk.zone.2F.04"]="Which way?",
    ["talk.zone.2F.05"]="The 55-metre lift, past the sidings.",
    ["talk.zone.2G.01"]="Below this cab I have no map at all. Only the signal.",
    ["talk.zone.2G.02"]="Can you still hear her?",
    ["talk.zone.2G.03"]="Yes... She hasn't stopped all morning.",
    ["talk.zone.2G.04"]="We're going down.",
    ["talk.zone.3A.01"]="That's the pump shaft... Can you see the bottom?",
    ["talk.zone.3A.02"]="No.",
    ["talk.zone.3A.03"]="Neither can my sensors. Watch out for Crickets, they're on every landing.",
    ["talk.zone.3B.01"]="EVE, a service line just lit up at this rest stop. It's ringing from all the way down. Shall I put it through?",
    ["talk.zone.3B.02"]="Put it through.",
    ["talk.zone.3B.03"]="Mom?",
    ["talk.zone.3B.04"]="... You're not Mom.",
    ["talk.zone.3B.05"]="My name is EVE. I heard your call.",
    ["talk.zone.3B.06"]="I'm Noa. I knew someone was coming. Level 2 lit up, one light at a time.",
    ["talk.zone.3B.07"]="So I rang every rest stop.",
    ["talk.zone.3B.08"]="EVE? Wait... You're the Angel! I gave you the letter, in Xion!",
    ["talk.zone.3B.09"]="That was you?",
    ["talk.zone.3B.10"]="Yohan told me to say I didn't know him. I did good, right?",
    ["talk.zone.3B.11"]="Where are you?",
    ["talk.zone.3B.12"]="With Ruben, in the drive room. Yohan's asleep. He sleeps a lot now.",
    ["talk.zone.3B.13"]="I'm coming down. Keep talking to me, Noa.",
    ["talk.zone.3B.14"]="Hold on... There, her line stays on your comm now. Hehe.",
    ["talk.zone.3B.15"]="Who's laughing?",
    ["talk.zone.3B.16"]="That's me, I'm Lily. Hi, Noa!",
    ["talk.zone.3B.17"]="Hi.",
    ["talk.zone.3C.01"]="Mom said to count to a thousand. That she'd be back before then.",
    ["talk.zone.3C.02"]="That's twelve times now.",
    ["talk.zone.3C.03"]="How long is a thousand?",
    ["talk.zone.3C.04"]="Seventeen minutes, if you don't skip.",
    ["talk.zone.3D.01"]="Are you in the well? Where the light comes in?",
    ["talk.zone.3D.02"]="One row is missing a can. There are four bolts on the rim.",
    ["talk.zone.3D.03"]="That's my can's spot. The bolts are so I can put it back in the right place.",
    ["talk.zone.3D.04"]="I grew a real leaf in it. Yohan says that's a lot already.",
    ["talk.zone.3F.01"]="EVE, wait. These Crickets are cut in two. The pipes are sawn clean through too.",
    ["talk.zone.3F.02"]="I know what does that.",
    ["talk.zone.3F.03"]="Like in Matrix 11... A Stalker. It hunts by sound, EVE. Noa, don't say anything for a minute, okay?",
    ["talk.zone.3G.01"]="EVE? You went quiet.",
    ["talk.zone.3G.02"]="(breathing) I'm fine. Go on, Noa.",
    ["talk.zone.3G.03"]="Yohan says talk slow so the air lasts. You said keep talking.",
    ["talk.zone.3G.04"]="So I'm doing both.",
    ["talk.zone.3H.01"]="EVE, I'm cutting her line for a second. She mustn't hear this. Those bodies, there, in the nests...",
    ["talk.zone.3H.02"]="Technicians. They've been here for years.",
    ["talk.zone.3H.03"]="And Noa is a few floors away from that...",
    ["talk.zone.3H.04"]="Give her the line back, Lily.",
    ["talk.zone.3I.01"]="Yohan's awake, wait.",
    ["talk.zone.3I.02"]="This is Yohan. Three-oh-one.",
    ["talk.zone.3I.03"]="Where is Noa's mother?",
    ["talk.zone.3I.04"]="... Noa, go sit with Ruben a minute.",
    ["talk.zone.3I.05"]="She went to start the fans. I went after her at three.",
    ["talk.zone.3I.06"]="Her lamp was on the floor at the foot of the first wall. Something big was asleep in the middle of the room.",
    ["talk.zone.3I.07"]="...",
    ["talk.zone.3I.08"]="Don't tell Noa.",
    ["talk.zone.3J.01"]="You're the man in the mask.",
    ["talk.zone.3J.02"]="Yes. An Angel had to see Warehouse 77.",
    ["talk.zone.3J.03"]="Who killed them?",
    ["talk.zone.3J.04"]="They ran from Xion. She found them there. That's all I know.",
    ["talk.zone.3J.05"]="I told the others the city didn't exist. It was the only way to keep them from going.",
    ["talk.zone.3J.06"]="Drain one, then the first pipe panel. Drain two, then the second.",
    ["talk.zone.3J.07"]="Every drain opens the old grates. Clear the hall each time.",
    ["talk.zone.3J.08"]="There's a woman in the Wasteland. Citizen 303.",
    ["talk.zone.3J.09"]="I came down for one night.",
    ["talk.zone.3J.10"]="Tell her I came back... that I tried.",
    ["talk.zone.3J.11"]="I'll tell her.",
    ["talk.zone.3J.12"]="Keep Noa talking.",
    ["talk.zone.3K.01"]="EVE, the signal drops with every step. I won't be able to follow you much further...",
    ["talk.zone.3K.02"]="Stay on the channel.",
    ["talk.zone.3K.03"]="I'm staying. But if I lose you, promise me you'll...",
    ["talk.zone.3K.04"]="Lily?",
    ["talk.zone.3K.05"]="... are you there? The stair eats the radio, Pia used to say.",
    ["talk.zone.3K.06"]="I'm here, Noa.",
    ["talk.zone.3K.07"]="I can still hear you. My radio's right below you.",
    ["talk.zone.4A.01"]="Can you see a lit window across the water? Near the red lamp.",
    ["talk.zone.4A.02"]="That's us. Watch.",
    ["talk.zone.4A.03"]="I see you.",
    ["talk.zone.4B.01"]="The way round is long... Through the tanks, Pia used to say.",
    ["talk.zone.4B.02"]="Ruben's asleep in his chair. He said to wake him for the eighteen hundred lift.",
    ["talk.zone.4B.03"]="You're talking slower, Noa.",
    ["talk.zone.4B.04"]="It's so the air lasts... I told you.",
    ["talk.zone.4C.01"]="Drain one's grates are bent outwards.",
    ["talk.zone.4C.02"]="Ines used to say there's something big in the fan room. Nobody goes in alone.",
    ["talk.zone.4C.03"]="Stay on the line, Noa.",
    ["talk.zone.4D.01"]="Something big was shouting. Was that you?",
    ["talk.zone.4D.02"]="It's gone.",
    ["talk.zone.4E.01"]="Are you at the fans? Mom went there.",
    ["talk.zone.4E.02"]="She had a yellow lamp.",
    ["talk.zone.4E.03"]="...",
    ["talk.zone.4E.04"]="Noa...",
    ["talk.zone.4E.05"]="... Noa? Who's talking to Noa?",
    ["talk.zone.4F.01"]="Is she alive?",
    ["talk.zone.4F.02"]="Yes, she's on the line. Noa, someone wants to talk to you.",
    ["talk.zone.4F.03"]="Noa, it's Mom.",
    ["talk.zone.4F.04"]="... Mom?",
    ["talk.zone.4F.05"]="You took so long.",
    ["talk.zone.4F.06"]="I know, I got stuck.",
    ["talk.zone.4F.07"]="I'm still counting.",
    ["talk.zone.4F.08"]="Keep counting. We're coming.",
    ["talk.zone.4F.09"]="Yohan! It's Mom!",
    ["talk.zone.4F.10"]="Pull that lever and go.",
    ["talk.zone.4G.01"]="The fans!",
    ["talk.zone.4G.02"]="Yohan says they don't fix our air. Not while the water's on the door.",
    ["talk.zone.4G.03"]="But they sound nice.",
    ["talk.zone.4H.01"]="It went down! I made a mark on the window.",
    ["talk.zone.4H.02"]="Sixteen-twelve.",
    ["talk.zone.4H.03"]="I'm going to sit by the radio now.",
    ["talk.zone.4I.01"]="I'm sleepy.",
    ["talk.zone.4I.02"]="Yohan's asleep again.",
    ["talk.zone.4I.03"]="I'll leave the radio on... So you'll hear me at the door.",
    ["talk.zone.4I.04"]="... three hundred and six... three hundred and seven...",
    ["talk.zone.4J.01"]="Noa, the water's down. I'm coming.",
    ["talk.zone.4J.02"]="Noa?",
    ["talk.zone.4K.01"]="... The water's down.",
    ["talk.zone.4K.02"]="She's asleep. She needs air.",
    ["talk.zone.4K.03"]="I'll turn... the wheel.",
    ["talk.zone.4L.01"]="May your memories live on...",
    ["talk.zone.4L.02"]="... forever...",
    ["talk.zone.4M.01"]="Surface lift. Up at 18:00.",
    ["talk.zone.4M.02"]="This is Noa. I'm in Matrix 13, at the very bottom, by the pumps.",
    ["talk.zone.4M.03"]="The water is halfway up the door and the fans have...",
    ["talk.zone.4N.01"]="... Noa?",
    ["talk.zone.4N.02"]="...",
    ["talk.zone.4N.03"]="Noa... You can stop counting now.",
    ["boss.Lion"]="Lion",
    ["boss.Gardener"]="Gardener",
    ["speaker.Noa"]="Noa",
    ["speaker.Yohan"]="Yohan",
    ["speaker.Mila"]="Mila",
}
